# PHASE 0 — Foundations

**Goal:** a deployable, authenticated, empty portal. No business logic.

### 0.1 Project scaffold and core utilities

- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, shadcn/ui initialised
- `lib/db.ts` — Mongoose connection singleton cached on `globalThis` so it survives
