- `lib/money.ts` — paise ↔ rupee conversion and an Indian digit-grouping display
  formatter, with unit tests
- `lib/phone.ts` — E.164 normalisation handling `9876543210`, `09876543210`,
  `+91 98765 43210`, with unit tests
- `lib/dates.ts` — `startOfDayIST`, `endOfDayIST`, `formatDate`, `daysUntil`,
  with unit tests
- Vitest configured; `.env.example` listing every variable the project will need

